1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,454
14 months.

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,071
So I stopped.

3
00:00:04,101 --> 00:00:06,020
And treated it like a project.

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,856
I looked at where
I actually fit,

5
00:00:07,886 --> 00:00:09,412
and where I didn't yet.

6
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,897
The gap's still on my résumé.

7
00:00:12,927 --> 00:00:15,329
It's just not the
headline anymore.

